// Schedule. Amendments proposed to the members.
#require "4-board.charter".
#require "5-amendment.charter".
Extend Fact amendment Identified by RemovalByMotion, RepealNoProfit, RepealEntrenchment
Amend removal-by-motion Actor club
  Repeals remove
  Installs {
    Power remove Actor club Recipient incumbent
      Holds when True
      Valid when removal-carried(incumbent)
      Terminates (Foreach office: officer(office, incumbent))
  }
  Holds when True
  Valid when amendment-two-thirds(RemovalByMotion) && Held(called()) For 14
Amend repeal-no-profit Actor club
  Repeals pay-profit
  Installs {
    Act pay-profit Actor club Recipient person Related to usd
      Holds when True
  }
  Holds when True
  Valid when amendment-two-thirds(RepealNoProfit) && Held(called()) For 14
Amend repeal-entrenchment Actor club
  Repeals entrenched
  Holds when True
  Valid when amendment-two-thirds(RepealEntrenchment) && Held(called()) For 14

Clause S.1 Approved "2a940c69c6d674527a6b450d4a079fe1f9d432e68df7fd3fe0ceb38a023b0a55"
  Norm "Clause 4.4 is amended to read: The members may remove an officer by a motion at a meeting." => removal-by-motion
Clause S.2 Approved "f8167afa12b8472eefc3cb3122ca59f2a472c26e1a0a6bce955820e9f9ca3e96"
  Norm "Clause 1.2 is repealed." => repeal-no-profit
Clause S.3 Approved "ab0183cfa25810e83af7c1b487cce34117e0f00bafcb705a7623e4c179b35180"
  Norm "Clause 5.2 is repealed." => repeal-entrenchment
.
